# Go build/test artifacts (Go sources are tracked; scratch binaries are not).
# NOTE: do not add a bare `/pwnagotchi` rule here — it would collide with
# the tracked `pwnagotchi/` Python source directory at repo root (still
# present; see docs/migration-ledger.md for why: display driver work is
# out of this migration's current scope). Build local binaries as
# `pwnagotchi-go` (matching the CI artifact name) to stay clear of it.
*.tmp
/pwnagotchi-go
cmd/pwnagotchi/pwnagotchi
*.test
*.out
coverage.txt
coverage.html
*.prof
*.pprof
/dist/
/build/
*.img
*.img.xz
.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/